From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Youwes09 <yuvi.shen@outlook.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 13:29:49 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] drm/apple: Expose the planes' blend mode

The DRM core warns about planes that offer formats with alpha but no
"pixel blend mode" property, since userspace can no longer assume
pre-multiplied alpha without it. DCP takes pre-multiplied or
non-pre-multiplied (coverage) alpha per surface, so expose both, with
the core's default of pre-multiplied, and blend formats with alpha as
the property asks. Formats without alpha keep their blending.

Before this, formats with alpha were always blended as coverage, though
userspace drew them pre-multiplied as DRM documented for drivers
without the property.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
Signed-off-by: Youwes09 <yuvi.shen@outlook.com>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/apple/plane.c | 11 +++++++++++
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/apple/plane.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/apple/plane.c
index 4befd25e107a..ed327348f17c 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/apple/plane.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/apple/plane.c
@@ -9,6 +9,7 @@
 
 #include <drm/drm_atomic.h>
 #include <drm/drm_atomic_helper.h>
+#include <drm/drm_blend.h>
 #include <drm/drm_fourcc.h>
 #include <drm/drm_fb_dma_helper.h>
 #include <drm/drm_framebuffer.h>
@@ -234,6 +235,8 @@ static void apple_plane_atomic_update(struct drm_plane *plane,
 	    fmt->format == DRM_FORMAT_XBGR8888 ||
 	    fmt->format == DRM_FORMAT_XBGR2101010)
 		is_premultiplied = true;
+	else if (fmt->has_alpha)
+		is_premultiplied = base->pixel_blend_mode == DRM_MODE_BLEND_PREMULTI;
 
 	new_state->src_rect = drm_to_dcp_rect_fp(&base->src);
 	new_state->dst_rect = drm_to_dcp_rect(&base->dst);
@@ -442,6 +445,7 @@ struct drm_plane *apple_plane_init(struct drm_device *dev,
 	struct apple_plane *plane;
 	const u32 *fmts;
 	u32 num_fmts;
+	int ret;
 
 	switch (type) {
 	case DRM_PLANE_TYPE_PRIMARY:
@@ -482,6 +486,13 @@ struct drm_plane *apple_plane_init(struct drm_device *dev,
 					  DRM_COLOR_YCBCR_BT709,
 					  DRM_COLOR_YCBCR_LIMITED_RANGE);
 
+	/* Each surface is either pre-multiplied or blended as coverage. */
+	ret = drm_plane_create_blend_mode_property(&plane->base,
+						   BIT(DRM_MODE_BLEND_PREMULTI) |
+						   BIT(DRM_MODE_BLEND_COVERAGE));
+	if (ret)
+		return ERR_PTR(ret);
+
 	if (type == DRM_PLANE_TYPE_PRIMARY)
 		drm_plane_helper_add(&plane->base, &apple_primary_plane_helper_funcs);
 	else
